          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Apply the local rule first. The West group is CA, OR, WA, NV, AZ, UT and ID. For remaining freight destinations, use the delivery address's time zone, including its local time zone in a split-time-zone state. Contact us for freight timing to Alaska, Hawaii, territories, Canada or other international destinations.</p>"
