    "rich_text_receiving_802": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Inspect the shipment and packaging at delivery. For visible damage, note \"shipping damage\" on the delivery receipt and contact us. You may accept or reject a damaged shipment. For minor or moderate damage, we recommend accepting delivery; we will send replacement parts and an installer to fix the damaged part. You may instead reject delivery and contact us to discuss the next steps.</p><p>Provide accurate contact and delivery/access information. Additional charges apply for cancellation after the item is loaded, being late for the agreed delivery appointment, storage when the customer does not respond to the shipper within five business days of its contact attempt, or a failed room-of-choice delivery caused by missing or inaccurate access information. Contact us when delivery is late, incomplete or needs to change.</p><p>Questions? Call 925-215-2927. Product preparation, shipment arrival and any installation appointment must be confirmed separately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_receiving": {
